  "name": "Slow Cooker Chicken Pot Pie",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken and vegetables in a creamy herb sauce",
  "description": "Chicken, vegetables, and herbs simmer together in a creamy sauce before peas and corn finish the filling.",
